{
 "cells": [
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "# `[3,1,0] (x) [3,1,0]`, L = 2 — which SoV states localize onto site 1?\n\n`dim [3,1,0] = 15`, so the chain space is `225`. Exact rationals throughout:\n`h = 1`, `θ[1] = 0`, `θ[2] = 1/2` (so site-1 roots are integers and site-2 roots are half-integers —\nthe two sites can never share a root).\n\n**No diagonalization of `B` is needed.** The SoV eigenvalue factorizes as `b(u) = b1(μ1) b2(μ2)`\nwith `b_a` a product of three linear factors rooted at `θ[a] + h n`. A state has site-2 label equal\nto the ground one iff `b(u)` vanishes at *all three* of the ground site-2 roots, i.e. iff the\ncovector lies in the left null space of `B(u)` at each of those three points. So the block of\n\"excitations on the first GT pattern only\" is an **intersection of three left null spaces** — a few\nexact `NullSpace` calls instead of a 225x225 eigen-decomposition.\n\nThe twist never enters: `B` is built from the untwisted `T` and quantum minors, and SoV\nnormalizations only rescale each `x`, so neither affects the spans computed here.",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* fresh state *)\nClearAll[\"Global`*\"];\nps[rep_] := ps[rep] = Block[{res = (Prepend[rep, #] & /@ (Tuples[Table[Range[rep[[1, i + 1]], rep[[1, i]]], {i, 1, Length[rep[[1]]] - 1}]]))}, If[Length[res[[1, 1]]] == 1, Reverse @ Sort @ res, Reverse @ Sort @ Flatten[ps /@ res, 1]]];\ndim[rep_] := dim[rep] = Length[ps[{rep}]];\nJ0[k_][pat_] := J0[k][pat] = Sum[pat[[k, i]], {i, 1, k}] - Sum[pat[[k - 1, i]], {i, 1, k - 1}];\nJp[k_][pat_] := Jp[k][pat] = -Sum[Product[pat[[k, i]] - i - pat[[k + 1, j]] + j, {j, Range[k + 1]}]/Product[pat[[k, i]] - i - pat[[k, j]] + j, {j, Complement[Range[k], {i}]}] v[ReplacePart[pat, {k, i} -> pat[[k, i]] + 1]], {i, 1, k}];\nJm[k_][pat_] := Jm[k][pat] = Sum[Product[pat[[k, i]] - i - pat[[k - 1, j]] + j, {j, Range[k - 1]}]/Product[pat[[k, i]] - i - pat[[k, j]] + j, {j, Complement[Range[k], {i}]}] v[ReplacePart[pat, {k, i} -> pat[[k, i]] - 1]], {i, 1, k}];\nJJ[k_, l_, rep_] := JJ[k, l, rep] = Which[k == l, DiagonalMatrix[J0[k] /@ ps[{rep}]], l == k + 1, Transpose[Table[Coefficient[Jp[k][ps[{rep}][[i]]], v[#]] & /@ ps[{rep}], {i, 1, Length[ps[{rep}]]}]], l == k - 1, Transpose[Table[Coefficient[Jm[l][ps[{rep}][[i]]], v[#]] & /@ ps[{rep}], {i, 1, Length[ps[{rep}]]}]], l > k + 1, JJ[k, k + 1, rep] . JJ[k + 1, l, rep] - JJ[k + 1, l, rep] . JJ[k, k + 1, rep], l < k - 1, JJ[k, k - 1, rep] . JJ[k - 1, l, rep] - JJ[k - 1, l, rep] . JJ[k, k - 1, rep]];",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
       "data": "<details class=\"vscode-wolfram-message-output\" style=\"color:#f44;border-left:3px solid #f44;background:rgba(255,68,68,0.08);padding:2px 6px;margin:1px 0;border-radius:0 3px 3px 0;font-family:monospace;font-size:0.85em\"><summary style=\"cursor:pointer\">4 warnings</summary><div style=\"padding:2px 0 2px 4px;border-top:1px solid rgba(255,68,68,0.15)\">ClearAll::wrsym: Symbol ClearGlobals is Protected.</div><div style=\"padding:2px 0 2px 4px;border-top:1px solid rgba(255,68,68,0.15)\">ClearAll::wrsym: Symbol VsCodeCleanupImgDir is Protected.</div><div style=\"padding:2px 0 2px 4px;border-top:1px solid rgba(255,68,68,0.15)\">ClearAll::wrsym: Symbol VsCodeDynExportValue is Protected.</div><div style=\"padding:2px 0 2px 4px;border-top:1px solid rgba(255,68,68,0.15)\">General::stop: Further output of ClearAll::wrsym will be suppressed during this calculation.</div></details>",
       "mime": "x-application/wolfram-language-html"
      },
      {
       "data": "ClearAll::wrsym: Symbol ClearGlobals is Protected.\nClearAll::wrsym: Symbol VsCodeCleanupImgDir is Protected.\nClearAll::wrsym: Symbol VsCodeDynExportValue is Protected.\nGeneral::stop: Further output of ClearAll::wrsym will be suppressed during this calculation.",
       "mime": "text/plain"
