      {
       "data": "Out[164]= \\begin{array}{|c|c|}\\hline\\text{dim [3,1,0]} & 15\\\\\\hline\\text{chain dim} & 225\\\\\\hline\\text{gl(3) relations site 1} & \\mathrm{True}\\\\\\hline\\text{GT patterns} & \\begin{matrix}\\left\\{\\left\\{3\\right\\},\\left\\{3,1\\right\\},\\left\\{3,1,0\\right\\}\\right\\}\\\\\\left\\{\\left\\{3\\right\\},\\left\\{3,0\\right\\},\\left\\{3,1,0\\right\\}\\right\\}\\\\\\left\\{\\left\\{2\\right\\},\\left\\{3,1\\right\\},\\left\\{3,1,0\\right\\}\\right\\}\\\\\\left\\{\\left\\{2\\right\\},\\left\\{3,0\\right\\},\\left\\{3,1,0\\right\\}\\right\\}\\\\\\left\\{\\left\\{2\\right\\},\\left\\{2,1\\right\\},\\left\\{3,1,0\\right\\}\\right\\}\\\\\\left\\{\\left\\{2\\right\\},\\left\\{2,0\\right\\},\\left\\{3,1,0\\right\\}\\right\\}\\\\\\left\\{\\left\\{1\\right\\},\\left\\{3,1\\right\\},\\left\\{3,1,0\\right\\}\\right\\}\\\\\\left\\{\\left\\{1\\right\\},\\left\\{3,0\\right\\},\\left\\{3,1,0\\right\\}\\right\\}\\\\\\left\\{\\left\\{1\\right\\},\\left\\{2,1\\right\\},\\left\\{3,1,0\\right\\}\\right\\}\\\\\\left\\{\\left\\{1\\right\\},\\left\\{2,0\\right\\},\\left\\{3,1,0\\right\\}\\right\\}\\\\\\left\\{\\left\\{1\\right\\},\\left\\{1,1\\right\\},\\left\\{3,1,0\\right\\}\\right\\}\\\\\\left\\{\\left\\{1\\right\\},\\left\\{1,0\\right\\},\\left\\{3,1,0\\right\\}\\right\\}\\\\\\left\\{\\left\\{0\\right\\},\\left\\{3,0\\right\\},\\left\\{3,1,0\\right\\}\\right\\}\\\\\\left\\{\\left\\{0\\right\\},\\left\\{2,0\\right\\},\\left\\{3,1,0\\right\\}\\right\\}\\\\\\le… [latex truncated: 1299 chars total]",
