  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* quantum minors and the B-operator, exactly as in the adj (x) adj / adj (x) fund notebooks *)\nQM[Ii_, Jj_][u_] := QM[Ii, Jj][u] = SparseArray @ Sum[\n    Signature[Permutations[Ii][[σ]]] (Dot @@ (T[#][u + h - h Position[Transpose[{Permutations[Ii][[σ]], Jj}], #] // Flatten // Last] & /@ Transpose[{Permutations[Ii][[σ]], Jj}])),\n    {σ, 1, Length[Permutations[Ii]]}];\nBop[u_] := Bop[u] = SparseArray[T[{1, 1}][u] . QM[{1, 2}, {1, 2}][u + h] + T[{2, 1}][u] . QM[{1, 2}, {1, 3}][u + h]];\nvacRef = UnitVector[dtot, dtot];   (* lowest (x) lowest, the SoV reference covector *)\n{Dimensions[Bop[7/3]], Timing[Bop[11/5];][[1]]}",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
