  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* left null spaces of B at the site-a special points u = θ[a] + h n.\n   The nullity counts how many of the 225 SoV labels have n among their site-a roots,\n   which validates the label convention  b_a(u) = (u-θa-h m12)(u-θa-h m11)(u-θa-h m22+h). *)\nlns[u_] := lns[u] = NullSpace[Transpose[Normal[Bop[u]]]];\npredCount[n_] := d1 Count[ps[{Λ[2]}], p_ /; MemberQ[{p[[2, 1]], p[[1, 1]], p[[2, 2]] - 1}, n]];\nGrid[Prepend[Table[{n, Length[lns[θ[2] + h n]], predCount[n]}, {n, -2, 4}],\n  {\"n\", \"dim left-null B(θ2+hn)\", \"predicted\"}], Frame -> All, Alignment -> Left]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
