  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* the rule reproduces the measured [2,1,0] answer {3,5,7,8}, and predicts other reps *)\nchkRule[lam_] := Module[{pp = ps[{lam}]},\n   {lam, Length[pp], Select[Range[Length[pp]], pp[[#, 1, 1]] == pp[[#, 2, 2]] &],\n    (lam[[1]] - lam[[2]] + 1) (lam[[2]] - lam[[3]] + 1)}];\nGrid[Prepend[chkRule /@ {{2, 1, 0}, {3, 1, 0}, {3, 0, 0}, {2, 2, 0}, {4, 2, 1}},\n  {\"lambda\", \"dim\", \"slots with m11==m22\", \"(l1-l2+1)(l2-l3+1)\"}], Frame -> All, Alignment -> Left]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
