  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "## Do these actually diagonalize `B`? — yes, checked\n\nThe null-space construction only shows `W1` is `B`-invariant (the `B(u)` commute, so a left null\nspace of one is preserved by all). Invariant is weaker than *spanned by eigenvectors*, so verify it\ndirectly — cheaply, as a `15 x 15` problem: restrict `B` to `W1`, diagonalize there, push the\neigenvectors back to 225 components, and confirm they are left eigenvectors of `B(u)` at `u` values\nnever used in the construction.",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* restrict B to W1:  W1 . B(u) = BWof[u] . W1 *)\nBWof[u_] := BWof[u] = Transpose[LinearSolve[Transpose[W1], Transpose[W1 . Normal[Bop[u]]]]];\nus = {7/3, 11/5, -3/4, 17/6, 5/9};\nBgen = Sum[Prime[10 + k] BWof[us[[k]]], {k, Length[us]}];\nGrid[{\n  {\"restriction exact (W1.B - BW.W1)\", Max[Abs[Flatten[BWof[7/3] . W1 - W1 . Normal[Bop[7/3]]]]] == 0},\n  {\"restricted B(u) all commute\", Max[Abs[Flatten[Table[BWof[us[[a]]] . BWof[us[[b]]] - BWof[us[[b]]] . BWof[us[[a]]], {a, 5}, {b, 5}]]]] == 0},\n  {\"distinct eigenvalues of a single B(7/3)|W1\", Length[Union[Eigenvalues[BWof[7/3]]]], \"<- 13: accidental collisions at that u\"},\n  {\"distinct eigenvalues of a generic combination\", Length[Union[Eigenvalues[Bgen]]], \"<- 15: simple\"},\n  {\"=> B|W1 is diagonalisable\", MatrixRank[Eigenvectors[Bgen]] == 15}\n  }, Frame -> All, Alignment -> Left]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
       "data": "<div class=\"wl-output-block\"><div class=\"wl-output-header\" style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;width:100%;min-height:22px;\" data-session-epoch=\"927746\" data-output-id=\"21\" data-out-n=\"193\" data-sub-idx=\"4\" data-output-format=\"WLLatex\" data-output-is-graphics=\"0\" data-cell-idx=\"10\" data-sub-start=\"4\" data-sub-end=\"10\"><span style=\"font-size:10px;color:#888;margin-right:8px;\">Out[193]=</span></div><div class=\"wl-output-content\"><div class=\"vscode-wolfram-wllatex-prerendered\" data-page-width-em=\"21\" data-latex-b64=\"\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:6.04em;vertical-align:-2.75em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:3.29em;\"><span style=\"top:-5.25em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:5.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mtable\"><span class=\"vertical-separator\" style=\"height:6em;border-right-width:0.04em;border-right-style:solid;margin:0 -0.02em;vertical-align:-2.75em;\"></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:0.5em;\"></span><span class=\"col-align-c\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:3.25em;\"><span style=\"top:-5.41em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">restriction exact (W1.B - BW.W1)</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.21em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">restricted B(u) all commute</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.01em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">distinct eigenvalues of a single B(7/3)|W1</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-1.81em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">distinct eigenvalues of a generic combination</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-0.61em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">=&gt; B|W1 is diagonalisable</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:2.75em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:0.5em;\"></span><span class=\"vertical-separator\" style=\"height:6em;border-right-width:0.04em;border-right-style:solid;margin:0 -0.02em;vertical-align:-2.75em;\"></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:0.5em;\"></span><span class=\"col-align-c\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:3.25em;\"><span style=\"top:-5.41em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">True</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.21em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">True</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.01em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">13</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-1.81em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">15</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-0.61em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">True</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:2.75em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:0.5em;\"></span><span class=\"vertical-separator\" style=\"height:6em;border-right-width:0.04em;border-right-style:solid;margin:0 -0.02em;vertical-align:-2.75em;\"></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:0.5em;\"></span><span class=\"col-align-c\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:3.25em;\"><span style=\"top:-5.41em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.21em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.01em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">&lt;- 13: accidental collisions at that u</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-1.81em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">&lt;- 15: simple</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-0.61em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:2.75em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:0.5em;\"></span><span class=\"vertical-separator\" style=\"height:6em;border-right-width:0.04em;border-right-style:solid;margin:0 -0.02em;vertical-align:-2.75em;\"></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.5em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:5.25em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.7em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:5.25em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.9em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:5.25em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-6.1em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:5.25em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-7.3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:5.25em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-8.5em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:5.25em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:2.75em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div></div></div>",
       "mime": "x-application/wolfram-language-html"
      },
      {
       "data": "Out[193]= \\begin{array}{|c|c|c|}\\hline\\text{restriction exact (W1.B - BW.W1)} & \\mathrm{True} & \\\\\\hline\\text{restricted B(u) all commute} & \\mathrm{True} & \\\\\\hline\\text{distinct eigenvalues of a single B(7/3)|W1} & 13 & \\text{<- 13: accidental collisions at that u}\\\\\\hline\\text{distinct eigenvalues of a generic combination} & 15 & \\text{<- 15: simple}\\\\\\hline\\text{=> B|W1 is diagonalisable} & \\mathrm{True} & \\\\\\hline\\end{array}",
       "mime": "text/plain"
      }
     ],
     "id": "8343cae3-41c8-486d-ad88-ede54974247f"
    }
   ],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* the 15 SoV covectors themselves. NOTE: w = c.W1 is a LEFT eigenvector of B when c is a\n   LEFT eigenvector of the restricted matrix, hence Transpose[Bgen]. *)\nxs = Eigenvectors[Transpose[Bgen]] . W1;\neigOK = And @@ Flatten[Table[MatrixRank[{xs[[i]], xs[[i]] . Normal[Bop[uu]]}] == 1,\n     {i, 15}, {uu, {13/7, -5/2, 23/9}}]];\nGrid[{{\"15 independent covectors\", MatrixRank[xs] == 15},\n      {\"each is a left eigenvector of B(u) at 3 FRESH u\", eigOK}}, Frame -> All, Alignment -> Left]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
       "data": "<div class=\"wl-output-block\"><div class=\"wl-output-header\" style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;width:100%;min-height:22px;\" data-session-epoch=\"927746\" data-output-id=\"22\" data-out-n=\"196\" data-sub-idx=\"3\" data-output-format=\"WLLatex\" data-output-is-graphics=\"0\" data-cell-idx=\"11\" data-sub-start=\"5\" data-sub-end=\"6\"><span style=\"font-size:10px;color:#888;margin-right:8px;\">Out[196]=</span></div><div class=\"wl-output-content\"><div class=\"vscode-wolfram-wllatex-prerendered\" data-page-width-em=\"22\" data-latex-b64=\"XGJlZ2lue2FycmF5fXt8Y3xjfH1caGxpbmVcdGV4dHsxNSBpbmRlcGVuZGVudCBjb3ZlY3RvcnN9ICYgXG1hdGhybXtUcnVlfVxcXGhsaW5lXHRleHR7ZWFjaCBpcyBhIGxlZnQgZWlnZW52ZWN0b3Igb2YgQih1KSBhdCAzIEZSRVNIIHV9ICYgXG1hdGhybXtUcnVlfVxcXGhsaW5lXGVuZHthcnJheX0=\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.44em;vertical-align:-0.95em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.49em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.45em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.45em;\"></span><span class=\"mtable\"><span class=\"vertical-separator\" style=\"height:2.4em;border-right-width:0.04em;border-right-style:solid;margin:0 -0.02em;vertical-align:-0.95em;\"></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:0.5em;\"></span><span class=\"col-align-c\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.45em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.61em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">15 independent covectors</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.41em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">each is a left eigenvector of B(u) at 3 FRESH u</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.95em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:0.5em;\"></span><span class=\"vertical-separator\" style=\"height:2.4em;border-right-width:0.04em;border-right-style:solid;margin:0 -0.02em;vertical-align:-0.95em;\"></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:0.5em;\"></span><span class=\"col-align-c\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.45em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.61em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">True</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.41em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">True</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.95em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:0.5em;\"></span><span class=\"vertical-separator\" style=\"height:2.4em;border-right-width:0.04em;border-right-style:solid;margin:0 -0.02em;vertical-align:-0.95em;\"></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.5em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.45em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.7em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.45em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.9em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.45em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.95em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div></div></div>",
