  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "## Result\n\nFor `[3,1,0] (x) [3,1,0]`: the SoV states with excitations on the **first GT pattern only** span a\n15-dimensional space `W1` (= `dim [3,1,0]`, as it must, and containing `<0| = e_225`).\n\n`B` restricted to `W1` is diagonalisable with simple spectrum, so `W1` really is the span of 15\nhonest SoV covectors — and each of them was checked to be a left eigenvector of `B(u)` at `u` values\nnever used to build it. (A *single* `B(u)` is not enough: at `u = 7/3` two of the 15 eigenvalues\ncollide accidentally, giving only 13 distinct values. A generic combination of `B` at several `u`\nseparates all 15.)\n\n**Each such `x` localizes on its own** — no combination is needed. Exactly 6 of the 15 do, and they\nare precisely the Gelfand-Tsetlin patterns with\n\n```\n   m11 = m22          (m12 unconstrained)\n```\n\n| localizes | `(m12; m11, m22)` |\n|---|---|\n| yes | `(1;0,0)  (2;0,0)  (3;0,0)  (1;1,1)  (2;1,1)  (3;1,1)` |\n| no  | `(1;1,0)  (2;1,0)  (3;1,0)  (2;2,0)  (3;2,0)  (3;3,0)  (2;2,1)  (3;2,1)  (3;3,1)` |\n\nTheir site-1 images are the coordinate directions of slots `{7, 9, 11, 13, 14, 15}`, so the\nlocalizing subspace is exactly `span{e*_7, e*_9, e*_11, e*_13, e*_14, e*_15}` — 6-dimensional.\n\n**Consistency.** The same rule applied to `[2,1,0]` gives slots `{3, 5, 7, 8}` — exactly what was\nmeasured for `adj (x) adj` and `adj (x) fund`. It also explains the shape of the answer there: the\nfree coefficients `aa`, `bb`, `cc` in that combination were free precisely because each of the four\n`x` states localizes separately.\n\n**Count.** `#{m11 = m22} = (l1 - l2 + 1)(l2 - l3 + 1)`: 4 for `[2,1,0]`, 6 for `[3,1,0]`.\n(`m22` free in `[l3, l2]`, `m11` then pinned, `m12` free in `[l2, l1]`.)\n\n**Predictions, not yet measured:** `[3,0,0]` -> 4 slots `{7,8,9,10}`, `[2,2,0]` -> 3 slots `{1,4,6}`.\nA rep with `l2 = l3` has a repeated entry in the ground site-2 root triple, so the null-space\nintersection used here needs an extra projection step before it isolates the ground block.",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  }
 ],
